# Large binary assets go to LFS. A .blend is ~57MB and is rewritten in full on
# every save, so a handful of turret re-splits would otherwise bloat the history
# by gigabytes. The source .glb are similar and never change once generated.
*.blend filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.glb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
